<!-- ══ SERVICES ══ -->
<section id="services" aria-labelledby="svc-heading">
  <div class="svc-head reveal">
    <span class="eyebrow">Our Services</span>
    <h2 class="sec-title" id="svc-heading">Every Inspection You Need,<br/>All Under One Roof</h2>
    <p class="sec-desc">From first brick to final possession — comprehensive property inspections by Hyderabad's most experienced civil engineering team.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="svc-grid">
    <article class="svc-card reveal">
      <div class="svc-num">Service 01</div>
      <div class="svc-icon" aria-hidden="true">🏠</div>
      <h3>Pre-Handover Comprehensive Inspection</h3>
      <p>End-to-end check of your new flat before possession — civil, electrical, plumbing, doors, windows, flooring, and all finishes covered by certified engineers.</p>
      <a class="svc-more" href="https://homecheck.in/living-condition-check/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn More →</a>
    </article>
    <article class="svc-card reveal">
      <div class="svc-num">Service 02</div>
      <div class="svc-icon" aria-hidden="true">🏗️</div>
      <h3>Multi-Stage Property Inspection</h3>
      <p>Inspect under-construction buildings at every key stage — foundation, slab, brickwork, plaster — catching structural issues before they're buried in concrete.</p>
      <a class="svc-more" href="https://homecheck.in/quality-inspection-check/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn More →</a>
    </article>
    <article class="svc-card reveal">
      <div class="svc-num">Service 03</div>
      <div class="svc-icon" aria-hidden="true">🌡️</div>
      <h3>Thermographic &amp; Seepage Inspection</h3>
      <p>Professional infrared thermal imaging detects hidden water seepage, moisture pockets, and electrical hotspots that are invisible to the naked eye.</p>
      <a class="svc-more" href="https://homecheck.in/thermographic-check/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn More →</a>
    </article>
    <article class="svc-card reveal">
      <div class="svc-num">Service 04</div>
      <div class="svc-icon" aria-hidden="true">📐</div>
      <h3>Area Measurement Inspection</h3>
      <p>Accurate measurement of carpet area, built-up area, and super built-up area — verify you've received the exact square footage you paid for.</p>
      <a class="svc-more" href="https://homecheck.in/area-measurment/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn More →</a>
    </article>
    <article class="svc-card reveal">
      <div class="svc-num">Service 05</div>
      <div class="svc-icon" aria-hidden="true">🔄</div>
      <h3>Re-Inspection Service</h3>
      <p>After builder fixes, we revisit to verify every defect is genuinely resolved — no more empty commitments or superficial patch-up jobs.</p>
      <a class="svc-more" href="https://homecheck.in/re-inspection/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn More →</a>
    </article>
    <article class="svc-card reveal">
      <div class="svc-num">Service 06</div>
      <div class="svc-icon" aria-hidden="true">🔑</div>
      <h3>Rental &amp; Handover Inspection</h3>
      <p>Moving in or tenant vacating? Document property condition with photographs and a detailed report — protect your deposit and avoid disputes.</p>
      <a class="svc-more" href="https://homecheck.in/request-for-home-check/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book Now →</a>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

