<!-- ══ FAQ ══ -->
<section id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
  <div class="faq-layout">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title" id="faq-heading">Questions Every<br/>Homebuyer Asks Us</h2>
      <p class="sec-desc">Everything you need to know before booking a home inspection in Hyderabad.</p>
      <a href="https://homecheck.in/faqs/" class="cta-primary" style="margin-top:28px; display:inline-flex;" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View All FAQs →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-list" role="list">
      <div class="faq-item reveal" role="listitem">
        <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-expanded="false">
          Why do I need a home inspection before possession?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">▼</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-a">Builders don't always disclose hidden defects. A professional inspection provides documented evidence to get all corrections done by the builder at zero cost — before you accept possession and lose all leverage.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal" role="listitem">
        <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-expanded="false">
          How much does a home inspection cost in Hyderabad?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">▼</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-a">Our fees are minimal compared to the cost of post-possession repairs. Pricing depends on property size and inspection type. Call +91 9701 172 777 for a quick custom quote — usually within minutes.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal" role="listitem">
        <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-expanded="false">
          What is thermographic / infrared inspection?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">▼</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-a">Thermographic inspection uses professional infrared cameras to detect hidden moisture, seepage, and electrical hotspots inside walls and ceilings — problems that look perfectly normal visually but cause serious long-term structural damage.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal" role="listitem">
        <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-expanded="false">
          How long does a home inspection take?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">▼</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-a">A standard 2BHK inspection takes 2–3 hours. Larger 3–4BHK properties and villas take 4–6 hours. The detailed photo-documented report is delivered via email within 48 hours of inspection completion.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal" role="listitem">
        <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-expanded="false">
          Which areas in Hyderabad do you cover?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">▼</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-a">We cover all major Hyderabad locations — Gachibowli, Kondapur, Miyapur, Kokapet, HITEC City, Financial District, Tellapur, Banjara Hills, Jubilee Hills, Madhapur, Kukatpally, Bachupally, Narsingi, Shamshabad, and more.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal" role="listitem">
        <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-expanded="false">
          Can I be present during the inspection?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">▼</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-a">Absolutely — we encourage it! Being present lets our engineer walk you through each finding in real-time, explain severity, and answer your questions on the spot so you fully understand your property's condition.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

